/span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会知道我也曾在那里</span></p><p begin="00:25.835" end="00:27.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:25.835" end="00:26.052">You'll</span> <span begin="00:26.052" end="00:26.269">see</span> <span begin="00:26.269" end="00:26.497">the</span> <span begin="00:26.497" end="00:26.723">wri</span><span begin="00:26.723" end="00:26.960">ting</span> <span begin="00:26.960" end="00:27.175">on</span> <span begin="00:27.175" end="00:27.395">the</span> <span begin="00:27.395" end="00:27.600">wall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会看见墙上的预言</span></p><p begin="00:27.600" end="00:29.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:27.600" end="00:27.845">I</span> <span begin="00:27.845" end="00:28.060">took</span> <span begin="00:28.060" end="00:28.291">it</span> <span begin="00:28.291" end="00:28.697">too</span> <span begin="00:28.697" end="00:29.150">far</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我做得太过火</span></p><p begin="00:29.382" end="00:31.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.382" end="00:29.620">And</span> <span begin="00:29.620" end="00:29.832">I</span> <span begin="00:29.832" end="00:30.057">could</span> <span begin="00:30.057" end="00:30.259">ne</span><span begin="00:30.259" end="00:30.480">ver</span> <span begin="00:30.480" end="00:30.675">get</span> <span begin="00:30.675" end="00:30.917">e</span><span begin="00:30.917" end="00:31.130">nough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我永远贪得无厌</span></p><p begin="00:31.130" end="00:32.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:31.130" end="00:31.372">I</span> <span begin="00:31.372" end="00:31.572">did</span> <span begin="00:31.572" end="00:31.807">a</span> <span begin="00:31.807" end="00:32.239">good</span> <span begin="00:32.239" end="00:32.669">job</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我做的很完美</span></p><p begin="00:32.905" end="00:34.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:32.905" end="00:33.132">And</span> <span begin="00:33.132" end="00:33.329">now</span> <span begin="00:33.329" end="00:33.569">I'm</span> <span begin="00:33.569" end="00:33.801">fi</span><span begin="00:33.801" end="00:33.905">nal</span><span begin="00:33.905" end="00:34.019">ly</span> <span begin="00:34.019" end="00:34.225">out</span> <span begin="00:34.225" end="00:34.461">of</span><span begin="00:34.461" end="00:34.902">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在我终于耗尽了——</span></p><p begin="00:34.902" end="00:36.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:34.902" end="00:35.117">I've</span> <span begin="00:35.117" end="00:35.336">been</span> <span begin="00:35.336" end="00:35.549">e</span><span begin="00:35.549" end="00:35.769">very</span><span begin="00:35.769" end="00:36.194">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾去到过每一个地方</span></p><p begin="00:36.419" end="00:38.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:36.419" end="00:36.652">Through</span> <span begin="00:36.652" end="00:36.870">e</span><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.101">very</span> <span begin="00:37.101" end="00:37.318">un</span><span begin="00:37.318" end="00:37.542">de</span><span begin="00:37.542" end="00:37.949">fended</span> <span begin="00:37.949" end="00:38.172">door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">穿过每一扇不设防的门</span></p><p begin="00:38.172" end="00:39.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:38.172" end="00:38.414">You'll</span> <span begin="00:38.414" end="00:38.609">know</span> <span begin="00:38.609" end="00:38.837">that</span> <span begin="00:38.837" end="00:39.044">I</span> <span begin="00:39.044" end="00:39.267">was</span> <span begin="00:39.267" end="00:39.684">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你会知道我也曾在那里</span></p><p begin="00:39.931" end="00:41.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:39.931" end="00:40.166">You'll</span> <span begin="00:40.166" en