 begin="01:46.405" end="01:46.614">sage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一条讯息</span></p><p begin="01:46.614" end="01:48.192" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:46.614" end="01:46.829">I</span> <span begin="01:46.829" end="01:47.055">know</span> <span begin="01:47.055" end="01:47.284">what</span> <span begin="01:47.284" end="01:47.486">you</span> <span begin="01:47.486" end="01:48.192">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我了解你的本质</span></p><p begin="01:48.375" end="01:50.114" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:48.375" end="01:48.603">I've</span> <span begin="01:48.603" end="01:48.814">al</span><span begin="01:48.814" end="01:49.045">rea</span><span begin="01:49.045" end="01:49.256">dy</span> <span begin="01:49.256" end="01:49.676">been</span> <span begin="01:49.676" end="01:50.114">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我早就经历过这一切</span></p><p begin="01:50.114" end="01:51.804" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:50.114" end="01:50.182">And</span> <span begin="01:50.182" end="01:50.309">I'm</span> <span begin="01:50.309" end="01:50.574">al</span><span begin="01:50.574" end="01:50.816">rea</span><span begin="01:50.816" end="01:51.024">dy</span> <span begin="01:51.024" end="01:51.804">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我已离去</span></p><p begin="01:52.344" end="01:53.644" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:52.344" end="01:52.577">And</span> <span begin="01:52.577" end="01:52.783">it's</span> <span begin="01:52.783" end="01:53.001">a</span> <span begin="01:53.001" end="01:53.429">les</span><span begin="01:53.429" end="01:53.644">son</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一场教训</span></p><p begin="01:53.644" end="01:55.199" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:53.644" end="01:53.879">You</span> <span begin="01:53.879" end="01:54.101">bot</span><span begin="01:54.101" end="01:54.331">tle</span> <span begin="01: